{"metadata":{"title":"Manual Integration","roleHeading":"Article","role":"article"},"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/NetworkTokenProvisioningGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/WalletExtensionsGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/SecurityGuide","doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/AdditionalResources"],"anchor":"Guides","generated":true}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/ManualIntegration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Download-the-SDK","text":"Download the SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"text","code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You also need the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning"},{"type":"text","text":" SDK, available from "