e iOS Simulator to verify basic initialization."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Test provisioning on a physical device (simulators do not support Apple Wallet).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Troubleshooting","text":"Troubleshooting","type":"heading","level":2},{"anchor":"No-such-module-NetworkTokenProvisioning","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"“No such module ‘NetworkTokenProvisioning’”"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure the XCFramework is added to your target’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" section and is set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"No-such-module-IssuingCommon","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"“No such module ‘IssuingCommon’”"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Same as above — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" must also be embedded. This framework contains shared types like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Runtime-crash-Library-not-loaded-IssuingCore","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Runtime crash: “Library not loaded: IssuingCore”"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" is not embedded. Add it to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" even though you don’t import it in code. The other frameworks depend on it at runtime."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Runtime-crash-Library-not-loaded-AdyenApplePayProvisioning","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Runtime crash: “Library not loaded: AdyenApplePayProvisioning”"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" is not embedded. It is a require